<span id="A1.T2.2.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.T2.2.1.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">ROSCOE Metric Attributes</span></span>
</span></th>
<th id="A1.T2.2.1.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_th ltx_th_column ltx_border_tt">
<span id="A1.T2.2.1.2.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:256.1pt;">
<span id="A1.T2.2.1.2.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.T2.2.1.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Description</span></span>
</span></th></tr>
</thead>
<tbody class="ltx_tbody">
<tr id="A1.T2.2.2" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A1.T2.2.2.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_border_t">
<span id="A1.T2.2.2.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:113.8pt;">
<span id="A1.T2.2.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_p">faithfulness</span>
</span></td>
<td id="A1.T2.2.2.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_border_t">
<span id="A1.T2.2.2.2.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:256.1pt;">
<span id="A1.T2.2.2.2.1.1" class="ltx_p">Mean alignment from the hypothesis chain to the context sentences; higher scores indicate better grounding by the context.</span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A1.T2.2.3" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A1.T2.2.3.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top">
<span id="A1.T2.2.3.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:113.8pt;">
<span id="A1.T2.2.3.1.1.1" class="ltx_p">faithfulness_ww</span>
</span></td>
<td id="A1.T2.2.3.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top">
<span id="A1.T2.2.3.2.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:256.1pt;">
<span id="A1.T2.2.3.2.1.1" class="ltx_p">Mean alignment of the sentence and token embeddings from the hypothesis chain to the context sentences and tokens.</span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A1.T2.2.4" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A1.T2.2.4.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top">
<span id="A1.T2.2.4.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:113.8pt;">
<span id="A1.T2.2.4.1.1.1" class="ltx_p">repetition_word</span>
</span></td>
<td id="A1.T2.2.4.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top">
<span id="A1.T2.2.4.2.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:256.1pt;">
<span id="A1.T2.2.4.2.1.1" class="ltx_p">For each step, gets the maximum alignment score between tokens in the current step and tokens in previous steps (token-level repetition).</span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A1.T2.2.5" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A1.T2.2.5.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top">
