<span id="A1.T2.2.5.1.1.1" class="ltx_p">repetition_step</span>
</span></td>
<td id="A1.T2.2.5.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top">
<span id="A1.T2.2.5.2.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:256.1pt;">
<span id="A1.T2.2.5.2.1.1" class="ltx_p">Maximum cosine similarity of each step to all previous steps (sentence-level repetition).</span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A1.T2.2.6" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A1.T2.2.6.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top">
<span id="A1.T2.2.6.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:113.8pt;">
<span id="A1.T2.2.6.1.1.1" class="ltx_p">informativeness_step</span>
</span></td>
<td id="A1.T2.2.6.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top">
<span id="A1.T2.2.6.2.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:256.1pt;">
<span id="A1.T2.2.6.2.1.1" class="ltx_p">Mean alignment from the sentences in the context to all steps in the chain and vice versa, averaged.</span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A1.T2.2.7" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A1.T2.2.7.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top">
<span id="A1.T2.2.7.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:113.8pt;">
<span id="A1.T2.2.7.1.1.1" class="ltx_p">informativeness_chain</span>
</span></td>
<td id="A1.T2.2.7.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top">
<span id="A1.T2.2.7.2.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:256.1pt;">
<span id="A1.T2.2.7.2.1.1" class="ltx_p">Cosine similarity between the overall hypothesis embedding and the context embedding.</span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A1.T2.2.8" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A1.T2.2.8.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top">
<span id="A1.T2.2.8.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:113.8pt;">
<span id="A1.T2.2.8.1.1.1" class="ltx_p">discourse_representation</span>
</span></td>
<td id="A1.T2.2.8.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top">
<span id="A1.T2.2.8.2.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:256.1pt;">
<span id="A1.T2.2.8.2.1.1" class="ltx_p">Maximum predicted probability of contradiction (from NLI model) between each step in the hypothesis and each sentence in the context.</span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A1.T2.2.9" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A1.T2.2.9.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top">
