<span id="A1.T2.2.9.1.1.1" class="ltx_p">coherence_step_vs_step</span>
</span></td>
<td id="A1.T2.2.9.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top">
<span id="A1.T2.2.9.2.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:256.1pt;">
<span id="A1.T2.2.9.2.1.1" class="ltx_p">Maximum probability of contradiction (from NLI model) between each step and all previous steps in the chain.</span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A1.T2.2.10" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A1.T2.2.10.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top">
<span id="A1.T2.2.10.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:113.8pt;">
