<span id="A1.T2.2.11.1.1.1" class="ltx_p">perplexity_step_max</span>
</span></td>
<td id="A1.T2.2.11.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top">
<span id="A1.T2.2.11.2.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:256.1pt;">
<span id="A1.T2.2.11.2.1.1" class="ltx_p">Maximum perplexity among all steps, where each step is scored individually.</span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A1.T2.2.12" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A1.T2.2.12.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top">
<span id="A1.T2.2.12.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:113.8pt;">
<span id="A1.T2.2.12.1.1.1" class="ltx_p">perplexity_chain</span>
</span></td>
<td id="A1.T2.2.12.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top">
<span id="A1.T2.2.12.2.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:256.1pt;">
<span id="A1.T2.2.12.2.1.1" class="ltx_p">Perplexity of the entire chain taken as a continuous string.</span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A1.T2.2.13" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A1.T2.2.13.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top">
