<span id="A1.T2.2.13.1.1.1" class="ltx_p">grammar_step</span>
</span></td>
<td id="A1.T2.2.13.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top">
<span id="A1.T2.2.13.2.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:256.1pt;">
<span id="A1.T2.2.13.2.1.1" class="ltx_p">Grammatical correctness of each step, as predicted by a grammaticality classifier and averaged over the chain.</span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A1.T2.2.14" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A1.T2.2.14.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_border_bb">
<span id="A1.T2.2.14.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:113.8pt;">
<span id="A1.T2.2.14.1.1.1" class="ltx_p">grammar_step_max</span>
</span></td>
