<section id="A1.SS5" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">A.5 </span>Human Annotators Results</h3>

<div id="A1.SS5.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.SS5.p1.1" class="ltx_p">The human evaluation results reported in this section are based on the average scores assigned by three independent annotators for each question. For every rationale, we take the mean of the three annotators’ scores to obtain a single human score per attribute. This approach helps mitigate individual annotator bias and provides a more robust measure of human preference.</p>
</div>
<section id="A1.SS5.SSS1" class="ltx_subsubsection">
<h4 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsubsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsubsection">A.5.1 </span>Chatbot Arena</h4>

